        "value": "<p><strong>Methodology </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Sample Type :</strong> EDTA whole blood</p>\n<p><strong>Method :</strong> Flowcytometry</p>\n<p><strong>Technique :</strong> Stain lyse wash, Lyse wash stain wash.</p>\n<p><strong>Instrument :</strong> BD Facs Canto II(3 Laser 8 Color)</p>\n<p><strong>Events acquired :</strong> 1,00,000/tube</p>\n<p><strong>Gating strategy :</strong> CD45/SS, CD19/SS</p>\n<p><strong>Antibodies :</strong> CD45,CD3,CD4,CD5,CD8,CD10,CD11c,CD19,CD20, CD22,CD23, CD25,CD38,CD43,CD56, CD79b,CD81,CD103,CD123,CD200,TCRgd,Kappa &amp; Lambda.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Impression : CD5+ve CD10-ve B cell Non Hodgkin lymphoma( B cell NHL). </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Advice: Cyclin D1 on trephine biopsy to rule out possibility of Mantle cell lymphoma</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Comments:</strong> CD19 vs SS scatter shows ~38% atypical lymphoid population which express dim CD5, moderate CD19, moderate CD20, heterogenous CD38, moderate CD79b, dim CD81, kappa light chain restriction and negative for CD23,CD43,CD200 &amp; other T lineage markers.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Immunophenotypic result</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"Table cke_show_border\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99%; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>MARKERS</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>INTENSITY</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>INTERPRETATION</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD3</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD4</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD5</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>DIM</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>POSITIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD8</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD10</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD11c</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD19</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>MODERATE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>POSITIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD20</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>MODERATE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>POSITIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD23</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD25</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD38</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>HETEROGENOUS</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>POSITIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD43</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD56</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>NEGATIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD79b</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>MODERATE</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>POSITIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD81</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>DIM</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>POSITIVE</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD103</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\